---
title: "Taking publishing away from a speaker"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: speaker
    lg1: cleanup
    lg2: settled
    lg3: Breaks DemotedPublishesOnlyWhileCleanupRuns or GivingUpLeavesNothingLive
    lg4: Path to the DemotedPublishesOnlyWhileCleanupRuns or GivingUpLeavesNothingLive bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Can publish, mic off
  s1: Can publish, mic off, mic request open
  s2: Can publish, mic off, mic request expired
  s3: Can publish, mic live, mic request open
  s4: Can publish, mic live, mic request expired
  s5: Cannot publish, mic live, mic request expired, mic stop waiting
  s6: Cannot publish, mic off, mic request expired
  s7: Cannot publish, mic live, mic request expired
  s8: Cannot publish, mic live, mic request expired, mic stop given up
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the speaker asks for the mic
  s1 --> s1: the request handler stops or the request goes to the SFU
  s1 --> s2: the request's 30 seconds run out
  s1 --> s3: the SFU turns the mic on
  s2 --> s2: the mic request is sent again or the request goes to the SFU
  s3 --> s4: the request's 30 seconds run out
  s4 --> s5: a host takes publishing away
  s5 --> s5: Sync picks up the mic stop or Sync's 60 seconds run out or the Sync node stops or Sync asks the SFU to switch the mic off or Sync waits for the SFU's answer
  s2 --> s6: a host takes publishing away [no mic seen, no open request]
  s6 --> s7: the SFU turns the mic on
  s5 --> s8: Sync gives up after its retries
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
